    <string name="settings_privacy_card_title">Your Personal Data Stays on Your Device</string>
    <string name="settings_privacy_card_content">Trustify is built from the ground up on technical privacy principles:\n\n• Zero Network Lookups: The core caller identification and classification engine runs 100% on-device. No internet permissions are requested.\n\n• No Account Required: You never need to sign up, provide an email, or create a profile to use Trustify.\n\n• Contacts Are Never Uploaded: The READ_CONTACTS permission is used strictly on-device to show your existing contact names during incoming calls. Contacts are never uploaded, scraped, or shared.\n\n• Trusted Numbers &amp; Call History: Your personal trusted callers, notes, and screening activity remain exclusively in your phone\'s local SQLite database and are excluded from cloud backups.\n\n• No Call Recording or Audio Interception: Trustify never records phone conversations or monitors call audio.</string>
